# Bulk run images never enter git: the held-out KEEP bin at production quality
# is ~2.5 MB/image x 120. Journals, run configs, summaries and contact sheets
# ARE committed — they are the evidence. Individually flagged images get copied
# out of images/ into evidence/ (committed) when the human pass cites them.
#
# The glob must cover EVERY round's output root, not just `out/`. Round 2 writes
# to `out_r2/` (AUDIT_OUT), and a rule anchored to `out/` silently let 348 files
# and 789 MB into a commit. Keep this pattern round-agnostic.
out*/*/images/
